      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This level of access can only be achieved if the platform would allow it. I can assure you, SteamVR will never allow this kind of access for reasons that should be obvious. Though I do agree it would be pretty cool. WMR already includes what you describe (introduced in Windows 1903) so your best bet is to take this request to your respective hardware platform.\n\nEdit: Apparently SteamVR does sort of allow this, but only for SteamVR hardware and it's not first-party support. YMMV",
