  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I really want to display my monitor through video screens. I know there is ovr drop but it doesnt just fit in the screens and it follows you around. I wish you could just be in a room and it would feel like your actually kind of in your house. You can play video games while in a virtual apartment on a virtual tv screen. Just be on your pc while in a virtual world. I guess they cant have it so everyone can see it since hackers can do stuff to your computer that way or something but it could just be on our side that could see it.",
